# Copy this to .private-terms and fill in the terms that must never be published.
# .private-terms is gitignored. This example file is not, and must stay generic.
#
# One term per line. Matching is case-insensitive and literal, not regex.
# Include: family names, your town and county, employer and client names,
# case or matter numbers, email addresses, phone numbers, home directory paths.

YourSurname
YourTown
your.email@example.com
